          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Syphon Filter 3 is a third-person shooter developed by Bend Studio and published by Sony Computer Entertainment. Released in November 2001 for the PlayStation, it is the third instalment in the Syphon Filter series. The game continues the story of secret agents Gabe Logan and Lian Xing as they are interrogated by a Senate committee about their previous missions. The narrative unfolds through flashbacks, revealing their battles against international conspiracies and bioterrorism.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Syphon Filter 3 es un juego de disparos en tercera persona desarrollado por Bend Studio y publicado por Sony Computer Entertainment. Lanzado en noviembre de 2001 para PlayStation, es la tercera entrega de la serie Syphon Filter. El juego continúa la historia de los agentes secretos Gabe Logan y Lian Xing, quienes son interrogados por un comité del Senado sobre sus misiones anteriores. La narrativa se desarrolla mediante flashbacks, que revelan sus batallas contra conspiraciones internacionales y el bioterrorismo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2001",
          "source": "igdb",
